{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123773","id":4618516046,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABE0j2Tg","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123773","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123773.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123773.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123773","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123773/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123773/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123773/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/1a013c14556df661ccb5300ad7dbeb0149d1e934","number":123773,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Allow creating a VisualShader node group from a selection","user":{"login":"Geometror","id":50084500,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMDg0NTAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50084500?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror","html_url":"https://github.com/Geometror","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This is a follow-up to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99404, adding one important UX improvement that speeds up node group creation significantly.\r\nAs always, this was a bit more sophisticated than anticipated.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1425\" height=\"693\" alt=\"Animation\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8cabc4cb-c489-42f3-a84f-af3cf5364bb2\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n## Detailed changes:\r\n- Adds a context menu option (\"Make Group\") for creating a group based on the current selection in the VisualShader editor\r\n\t- Replaces the selection after validating (to prevent cycles or forbidden nodes moving in) with a node group instance (everything stays connected, so the operation is seamless); undo/redo works of course \r\n\t- Multiple connections from the same output port share one group port; group ports are sorted based on the position of the source nodes to minimize \"entanglement\"; group port names are based on the inner port they are connected to (with a fallback to that node's caption).\r\n- Refactoring along the way:\r\n\t- Made NodeMenuOptions and ConnectionMenuOptions enum class to avoid the MAKE_GROUP name clash (+ we want to move to enum class in general)\r\n\t- Refactor node deletion a bit (use LocalVector instead of List)\r\n\r\n## Notes:\r\n- A remaining TODO is to add a shortcut (Ctrl + G) for this, but that might conflict with grouping in the 2D/3D editor (need to investigate)\r\n- I'd really like to deprecate `VisualShaderNodeGroupBase` since it's a relic from the past. Ideally the Expression node should be overhauled to use the same mechanisms for port management as node groups.\r\n- I have a refactor/cleanup PR for the port expansion code in the works which should get rid of ~300 LOC.\r\n\r\nAI Disclosure: AI was used as part of a review pass at the end; resulting changes were done manually or in the form of surgical instructions.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement